sequenceDiagram
    actor U as User

    participant C   as BestAmpUI.Client
    participant B   as BestAmpUI.Bridge
    participant A1  as BestAmp


    %% start

    U ->> C: Updates dial value
    activate C
    C ->> B: `send(Dials.BuildMsg())`
    activate B
    B ->> A1: 
    Note right of B: forward websocket to tcp
    activate A1
    Note right of A1: process message type `2`<br/>as of 20261022 this cannot fail
    A1 -->> B: response type 9998, OK
    deactivate A1
    B -->> C: response type 9998, OK
    deactivate B
    C -->> U: Sees the message response
    deactivate C

    %% end